      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef fit_weights(X, y):\n    X, y = np.array(X, dtype=float), np.array(y, dtype=float)\n    A = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(X)), X])\n    return np.linalg.solve(A.T @ A, A.T @ y).round(4).tolist()\n\nX = [[1, 2], [2, 1], [3, 4], [4, 3], [5, 5]]\ny = [9, 6, 17, 14, 21]\nprint(fit_weights(X, y))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef fit_weights(X, y):\n    X, y = np.array(X, dtype=float), np.array(y, dtype=float)\n    A = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(X)), X])\n    return np.linalg.solve(A.T @ A, A.T @ y).round(4).tolist()\n\nX = [[1, 2], [2, 1], [3, 4], [4, 3], [5, 5]]\ny = [9, 6, 17, 14, 21]\nprint(fit_weights(X, y))\n```"
